            "type": "ontology",
            "catalogue": [
                "GoTriple"
            ],
            "description": "The core ontology of the GoTriple platform, providing the shared conceptual model for describing Social Sciences and Humanities (SSH) research resources. It is organised into a set of modules and controlled vocabularies covering documents, datasets, media objects, projects, profiles, semantic artefacts, and the vocabularies for licenses, access conditions, content types, disciplines, and project types.",
